  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Heat Mitigation Strategy for Tamil Nadu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project, in collaboration with the state planning commission, will develop a Heat Mitigation Strategy for Tamil Nadu which will include a baseline assessment of the existing resources and mechanisms to address urban extreme heat, policy recommendations to address the issues at hand and propose an action plan to mitigate risks in case of any future extreme heat event.</narrative>
  </description>
